# Local runtime data (dev/test SQLite files, logs) - never committed,
# CIP is local-first and every install owns its own local database. Does
# NOT apply to pilot-evidence/ - those *.log files are deliberately
# collected qualification evidence, not local runtime data, and must be
# committed (see docs/phase-3-3-pilot-qualification.md, docs/phase-3-4-windows-pilot.md).
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.log
!pilot-evidence/**/*.log
